    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d539">

                <pb facs="0773" n="677" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg677"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Day to Mr.
                            Woodford.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-03-04"><hi rendition="#italic">March 4,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Spanish chargé presented here yesterday matter covered in yours 3d. Explained to
                    him that vessels are the <hi rendition="#italic">Montgomery</hi> and <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Nashville</hi>, small cruiser and gunboat. <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Montgomery</hi> has called at Cuban ports recently. At
                    request relief committee these ships will take load of supplies Key West to
                    Matanzas and Sagua next week. This is the most prompt and efficient means of
                    getting supplies to people greatly in need.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Day.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
